 <name>Figaro's Password Manager 2</name>
 <summary>Figaro's Password Manager 2</summary>
 <description>
 <p>
    FPM2 is a GUI password manager using the GTK3 libraries. 
    Passwords are encrypted using the AES-256 GCM algorithm.
 </p>
 </description>
